meta {
  name: Auth
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  GoTrue signup/login for the three seeded V1 roles (organizer/admin, participant, judge — T4's profiles-mirror trigger creates public.profiles on signup). Run the three "Sign Up" requests first on a fresh database; on a re-run against an already-seeded database, use "Log In" instead (Sign Up returns 422/400 for an existing email). QA19: GoTrue signups never get profiles.is_organizer (only the app's api/organizer-signup route grants it), so the organizer-flag requests use {{secret_key}} to set it on the admin and reset it on the password-backed participant/judge accounts that stand in for magic-link users. Every request downstream authenticates with the JWTs captured here.
}
